Then run a transformation using Excel_XML_output_to_RDF.xsl.\
Easiest way is from the command line, with a command like this:\
\
     /usr/bin/java -jar /opt/local/saxon/saxon9he.jar [path]/NCSE_metadata_spreadsheet.xml [path]/Excel_XML_output_to_RDF.xsl > foo.xml\
\
(obviously your paths may vary),.  You should first open foo.xml and check the variable values, because if any of those are wrong there's no point in checking any of the RDF files until you fix the problem.\
